   "date": "2011-11-02",
   "text": "Growing Jobs Through Capital Act of 2011 - Amends the Internal Revenue Code to exclude gain from the sale or exchange of a capital asset from gross income for income tax purposes. Terminates such tax exclusion two years after the enactment of this Act."
